# Sudoku Solver using CSP

## Problem Description
This project solves Sudoku puzzles using Constraint Satisfaction Problem (CSP) techniques and Backtracking Algorithm in Python.

The program automatically fills empty cells while following Sudoku constraints:
- Each row must contain numbers 1 to 9 without repetition
- Each column must contain numbers 1 to 9 without repetition
- Each 3x3 grid must contain numbers 1 to 9 without repetition

---

## Algorithms Used
- Constraint Satisfaction Problem (CSP)
- Backtracking Algorithm

---

## Features
- Solves Sudoku puzzles automatically
- Validates rows, columns, and 3x3 boxes
- Displays original and solved Sudoku board
- Simple Python implementation

---

## Technologies Used
- Python

